#==============================================================================================
#
#   element_resize_action - Web::ElementResizeAction: resizing an element with `resize` by its
#   gripper, and the copies of the page's input events without their browser data
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Page/ElementResizeAction.cpp (lines 1-105) and InputEvent.cpp
#       lines 14-27 (the clone_without_browser_data functions; the IPC encoders and decoders
#       after them belong to the IPC layer, which phase 1 does not have).
